  m_text: '"COSTCO": A variation of TicTacToe played on a larger board. After one
    player connections 3-in-a-row, the other players are put in to Check. They must
    now make a move that also connects 3-in-a-row. Play continues until a player
    cannot make a new connection. Last one standing wins. Double-connections require
    a double-connection in response.'
